  "ingredients": [
    "2 large egg",
    "5 ounce frozen spinach",
    "1/2 medium yellow onion (finely chopped)",
    "1 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "2 tablespoon fresh basil (chopped)",
    "1/2 medium lemon (sliced)",
    "12 ounce salmon",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "4 tablespoon butter",
    "2 tablespoon fresh chives (finely chopped)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients. Preheat oven to 365F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/salmon-en-papillote-with-spinach-and-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53957-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Salmon-en-Papillote-with-Spinach-and-Eggs-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a pot, boil water. Place eggs in the boiling water carefully. Let the eggs boil for 5 minutes, then take out of the pot and place in ice cold water.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/salmon-en-papillote-with-spinach-and-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53957-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Salmon-en-Papillote-with-Spinach-and-Eggs-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel the eggs then chop the eggs up.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/salmon-en-papillote-with-spinach-and-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53957-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Salmon-en-Papillote-with-Spinach-and-Eggs-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "On a piece of parchment paper, place the frozen spinach in the middle and top with the chopped onion.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/salmon-en-papillote-with-spinach-and-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53957-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Salmon-en-Papillote-with-Spinach-and-Eggs-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, add the chopped up eggs and salmon on top of the spinach and onion.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/salmon-en-papillote-with-spinach-and-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53957-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Salmon-en-Papillote-with-Spinach-and-Eggs-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put garlic, basil, and sliced lemons over the salmon. Season with salt and pepper and top it off with butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/salmon-en-papillote-with-spinach-and-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53957-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Salmon-en-Papillote-with-Spinach-and-Eggs-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold the parchment paper over so all the ingredients are enclosed. Transfer this to a baking sheet and bake in the oven for 15 - 25 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/salmon-en-papillote-with-spinach-and-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53957-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Salmon-en-Papillote-with-Spinach-and-Eggs-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garnish with chives. Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/salmon-en-papillote-with-spinach-and-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53957-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
